From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 23:05:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 4126 item 3: the registration run keeps the people a public
 list names (OFF)

The list_people table (f8d0dbf) was built and nothing wrote to it. When
a page about a new user is a public member, staff or attendee list, the
extractor now also returns the people it names, kept in list_people with
the page and the day, never as a knows link. Only the new user's own
entry can join a number (same name and organisation).

LIST_PEOPLE_ON is false: the brief gains LIST_PEOPLE_BRIEF only while it
is on, so the live brief is unchanged until Misho says yes to that text.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
